  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The text of the poem, "La señal" is written on a single sheet, rolled up to form a scroll and tied with string. The vial contains sand and a small piece of newspaper folded to form a tiny boat. The two items are housed in a box constructed of corrugated cardboard which contains a diarama depicting a beach scene with a boy pointing at the sky.</subfield>
